  "openQuestions": [
    "Only 급여제한여부 '01' (무자격자) switches 건보 → 일반. Codes 02-05 (체납, 사망, 국외이민) do not. desk.md says 'if 급여제한여부 is present' and front-desk.md maps it to NHIS_BENEFIT_RESTRICTED; the server must decide whether 02-05 also restrict.",
    "The client switches insurance type automatically with a warning instead of rejecting. The redesign returns 422 NHIS_BENEFIT_RESTRICTED.",
    "Selected-institution gate applies only to medical-aid (자격여부 7/8) patients whose 본인부담여부 is M001/M002/B001/B002 and whose 선택기관기호1-4 do not include this clinic's 요양기관기호. B005 itself is the clerk's choice, not the trigger.",
    "Picking B006/B008 with an institution still blocks the gate (ta is true for anything other than U001/B005), although AD accepts it. Possibly a bug.",
    "Auto-insurance limit: blocked only when total > limit (total == limit passes) and limit > 0. A non-numeric or empty limit disables the check.",
    "The limit dialog has only a '확인' button; the check-in aborts only if the dialog resolves truthy. If closing the dialog resolves falsy, check-in proceeds. BaseConfirmDialog's close value was not traced.",
    "Guarantee expiry is not a validation: an expired 보증종료일자 (before today) only stops prefilling the previous visit's auto-insurance data. A manually entered expired guarantee is not rejected. The redesign's AUTO_INSURANCE_CASE_EXPIRED has no client counterpart.",
    "Today-only check-in from an appointment is a button disable (isToday(예약일자)) in the planner detail panel; POST /desk/waiting itself sends 예약Id without a date check.",
    "Self-verification (본인확인) is required when first visit or last 본인확인일자 is older than 6 months (exactly 6 months ago counts as within); exempt for 본인확인예외여부 'Y', under 19, pregnant, or 건보 100%. Age is computed by the client's mx() helper, which the harness did not execute."
  ]
}
